{
    "title": "QR Elite-Code Linker",
    "description": "QR Elite-Code Linker is a powerful yet simple-to-use QR code scanner and generator that makes scanning and creating QR codes easy and efficient.\r\n\r\nMain Feature:\r\n1.**Quick Scan**: Just point your mobile phone camera at the QR code, and QR Elite-Code Linker can quickly identify and interpret the information, saving you time.\r\n2.**Widely applicable**: Whether the QR code contains a URL, text, contact information or other information, QR Elite-Code Linker can accurately interpret it and allow you to get the content you need.\r\n3.**Personalized experience**: According to your preferences, you can choose your favorite QR code style to create your own QR code.\r\n4.**History**: All scanned QR codes will be recorded so that you can view and recall them at any time.\r\n5.**Sharing function**: Easily share the created QR code to social media, SMS or email to share valuable information with friends, colleagues or family.\r\n6.**Export and Save**: You can copy important scan results for easy saving and backup.\r\n\r\nWhether you are shopping, traveling, studying or working, QR Elite-Code Linker can be your right assistant. It simplifies interaction with QR codes, making it easier for you to access information. Download QR Elite-Code Linker and start an efficient and intelligent QR code scanning journey!",
    "descriptionHTML": "QR Elite-Code Linker is a powerful yet simple-to-use QR code scanner and generator that makes scanning and creating QR codes easy and efficient.<br><br>Main Feature:<br>1.**Quick Scan**: Just point your mobile phone camera at the QR code, and QR Elite-Code Linker can quickly identify and interpret the information, saving you time.<br>2.**Widely applicable**: Whether the QR code contains a URL, text, contact information or other information, QR Elite-Code Linker can accurately interpret it and allow you to get the content you need.<br>3.**Personalized experience**: According to your preferences, you can choose your favorite QR code style to create your own QR code.<br>4.**History**: All scanned QR codes will be recorded so that you can view and recall them at any time.<br>5.**Sharing function**: Easily share the created QR code to social media, SMS or email to share valuable information with friends, colleagues or family.<br>6.**Export and Save**: You can copy important scan results for easy saving and backup.<br><br>Whether you are shopping, traveling, studying or working, QR Elite-Code Linker can be your right assistant. It simplifies interaction with QR codes, making it easier for you to access information. Download QR Elite-Code Linker and start an efficient and intelligent QR code scanning journey!",
